### 1.5 Permission & Access Control Auditor
**Checks**:
- File system permissions (read/write/execute on critical paths)
- `.task-memory/` sidecar access permissions
- Configuration file accessibility
- Secret/credential store accessibility
- User/role capabilities
- API key/token validity (with safe testing)

